{"version":1,"content":"<p>一代洪拳宗師劉家良入室弟子、知名龍虎武師何麥（Mark Houghton）於10月5日離世，終年64歲。</p><p>其家屬日前在紅磡世界殯儀館設靈出殯，沒想到喪禮過後，竟引爆親生女兒何慈茵與父親生前伴侶Christie的連番爆開火，雙方由喪禮現場戰至網</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.025847+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"b70a2ea17634303a239a0b74c6225c25542217745672a092255104dbb9118c95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}